BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:TWiV 1368: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin
DTSTART:20261024T040000Z
DTEND:20261024T050000Z
DTSTAMP:20261028T061106Z
UID:318b236696f1c054@gid-seminars.wnprc.wisc.edu
CATEGORIES:Podcast - TWiV
DESCRIPTION:[Podcast: This Week in Virology]\n\nIn his weekly clinical upd
 ate\, Daniel Griffin and Vincent Racaniello are discouraged by the continu
 ous attack on vaccines especially the birth dose of the hepatitis B virus 
 vaccine\, effects of the 2026 changes in immunization schedule\, the globa
 l burden of vaccine preventable diseases including pertussis and measles\,
  expansion of the Bundibugyo ebolavirus outbreak in Kenya\, &nbsp\;increas
 e in rabies diagnosis in the US and screwworm cases before Dr. Griffin dee
 p dives into recent statistics RSV\, influenza\, SARS-CoV-2 infections\, m
 easles including an 8% increase in confirmed cases in 1 week in the US and
  its history especially the Faroe Island outbreak in 1846\, warnings of co
 ngenital measles\, &nbsp\;effect of Fluvoxamine and Metformin to combat fa
 tigue of long COVID and contacting your federal government representative 
